/10 Ask calls answered with the checks met (consistency across repeats)"},"testCase":{"id":"74d28582d4762f47462cf758b54ed6c8","externalId":"dc9ccde5e026612dabfa9390caa458e7","name":"[dev] S18 Ask AI answer time and model, 10 calls with the labs preset","fullName":"TC-15 Ask AI › TC-15/S18"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-15 Ask AI · <b>S18</b> 「Ask AI 的回答时间和模型，用化验快捷问题调 10 次」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Ask AI answer time and model, 10 calls with the labs preset</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U12</b> Each Ask AI call records the model that answered (fellBackFrom on a fallback) and the AI call time separately from the total; a dictated question records the speech-to-text engine.（UAT 3.1；UAT 3.5；UAT 3.9）</li><li><b>U1</b> Each of the six quick-question presets (today's labs, current medications, pre-round note contents, urgent pending tasks, current diagnosis, symptoms mentioned) returns a correct, patient-specific an …（UAT TC-15；TFA-92593 AC 4）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>性能（performance） — 量时间，看是不是在要求的秒数里。</p><p><b>Given </b>S01 Hospital fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Ask &quot;What were today's labs?&quot; 10 times</p><p><b>Then </b>Each answer arrives with the stored lab; for each call durationMs, providerMs and the model id are recorded from aiCallLog</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>Fail only if a call errors, the answer lacks the stored lab, or providerMs is missing from its log row (3.5: AI time logged separately from the total). A call over 30 s is flagged for review, not Fail (3.5 'targets, not pass/fail'; Q7)</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U37；测试方法 PERF · 性能计时；矩阵里排的车道 AI 检查（automated）</p><p><small>S18 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-15.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>PERF · 性能计时；辅助：AICHECK · AI 输出检查 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-15 Ask AI · <b>Section:</b> A3 · Encounter · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-15/S18</p><p><b>Ask AI answer time and model, 10 calls with the labs preset</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92593 Ask AI (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U37.verdict.json</code>), unit U37. Agent: 70 turns, 458 s, $0.36.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s18-cp05.md: (3.9: the answering model per call (RG-MODEL), read backend/log5.json) pass: backend log5 [fn=assist.askChart].model exists</li><li>s18-cp05.md: (3.9: whether any call fell back to the backup model) pass: backend log5 [fn=assist.askChart].fellBackFrom is missing</li><li>s18-cp10.md: (3.9: the answering model per call (RG-MODEL), read backend/log10.json) pass: backend log10 [fn=assist.askChart].model exists</li><li>s18-cp10.md: (3.9: whether any call fell back to the backup model) pass: backend log10 [fn=assist.askChart].fellBackFrom is missing</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U37 (#37, ready-for-qa, live AI (Save Note / Save &amp; Extract / Ask AI)) — Pre-Round Ask: 10 timed calls. Counts askChart rows in diagnostics:list (5, then 8); any other Ask call in the case would change the counts.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #37, U37; checked: yes): <b>Blocked → runner fix</b> — 7/10 calls done, budget (50) ran out on dev. Same as U36 → systemic: agent-prompt.mjs now gives dev runs 1.6× steps/turns (cap 150). Re-run below</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #37b; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — 10/10 Ask calls answered with the checks met (consistency across repeats)</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-15 Ask AI","S18 Ask AI answer time and model, 10 calls with the labs preset"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":tru